							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">Is Chillmatic writing for the Stranger now? Seems like the Stranger was doing well with hip hop and now they are sliding back down hill. Sort of funny, I wonder if they realize how irrelevant they were before Sam, Mizel and Mudede started covering hip hop, especially the local scene the paper ignored for over a decade. Maybe they&#039;ll slide back to that space, god I hope not. <br /><br /><a href="http&#58;//www.thestranger.com/seattle/Content?oid=180349" target="_blank">http://www.thestranger.com/seattle/Content?oid=180349</a></div>
