	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg21716"></a>
		<table width="100%" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed;">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="16%" rowspan="2" style="overflow: hidden;">
							<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=1071" title="View the profile of jz">jz</a></b>
							<div class="smalltext">
								Newbie<br />
								<img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=1071"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:jzwickel@thestranger.com"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</div>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=1446.msg21716#msg21716"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=1446.msg21716#msg21716">Re: New ignorant Stranger hip hop writer disses Blue Scholars - and no one cares</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #6 on:</b> March 21, 2007, 06:33:06 pm &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">youre gonna judge the strangers hiphop coverage on one critical article? thats unfair and misguided. in the five weeks ive been here, i took on coke rap, mudede talked about hiphop hangout hidmo, mizells columns have made some powerful assertions, matson questioned the rawkus move; next weeks lead feature is on local hiphop and there are more in the works. were actually probing issues and analyzing the scene, local and national, not just propping up artists. im not sure what youre looking for in a music section but that to me is what its all about and its not gonna change.<br /><br />ive heard from others who agree w matson. as much as you and the scholars would like it to be, its not a one-sided issue. i know you know this: its dialog and its a good thing no matter what. ultimately, fans dont give a shit about record labels, its the music that matters. if theres an issue there thats another story.<br /><br />to stop reading or castigate the stranger bc of this piece or to encourage your message board members to do so is a mistake.</div>
						</td>
					</tr>
