							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">another thing i wasnt feeling abotu the article ?<br /><br /><br />dude has the nerve to say...<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: article in the stranger</div><div class="quote"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"> We&#039;ve long had a tendency to intellectualize the music</span>, assuming &quot;real&quot; hiphop lives in NYC or elsewhere. That the Emerald City celebrates the Scholars and the Mass Line record label while largely ignoring its own vibrant gangsta scene<br /></div><br />intelectualize the music ?  aint that the truth..  i mean.. aint that this article. <br />and...  after complaint about  <span style="color: Green;">SEATTLE</span> supports massline but  not its gansta scene ?  did he even notice he just wrote a whole article about massline and not the gangsta scene ?   how are peopel supposed to know about it if the writer aint telling em ?  he sure found time to write about massline. good job dude.. your really helping the gangster scene.<br />im sure he coulda served his cause better with an article abotu dimedef&#039;s upcomign realease...rather than this.<br /></div>
